  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU4BiodiversityInSevan: Enhancing Lake Sevan Ecosystem Restoration</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Overall objective of the &#x201c;Enhancing Lake Sevan Ecosystem Restoration - EU4biodiversityinSevan&#x201d; Project is to foster an enabling environment for the restoration of Lake Sevan ecosystem. This involves strengthening the management capacities of relevant state institutions, implementing effective ecosystem restoration measures, including measures for biodiversity conservation, as well as introducing sustainable financing and incentive mechanisms.</narrative>
  </description>
